For QFX devices, you can use sFlow.

```junos
protocols {
    sflow {
        agent-id 203.0.113.4;
        polling-interval 5;
        sample-rate ingress 8192;
        source-ip 203.0.113.4;
        collector 192.0.2.1 {
            udp-port 6343;
